            "text": "<p>In addition to preserving memories, now we want to make memories with you. Rebel Nell events is an extension of that belief, to bring people together in real time—to create, reflect, heal, and connect through shared moments. From intimate gatherings and creative workshops to larger community celebrations, each experience is designed with intention. Some events are free, others ticketed based on what it takes to host them, but all are rooted in the same purpose: creating moments that matter and building meaningful connection, together.</p>"
